"sand"},{"surface":"சேர்ப்பனை","parts":[{"text":"சேர்ப்பன்","lemma":"சேர்ப்பன்","gloss":"lord of the coast"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"accusative marker"}],"gloss":"the lord of the coast"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யான்","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"too"},{"surface":"காதலென்","parts":[{"text":"காதல்","lemma":"காதல்","gloss":"love"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"I am"}],"gloss":"am in love"},{"surface":"யாய்","parts":[{"text":"யாய்","lemma":"யாய்","gloss":"my mother"}],"gloss":"my mother"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"too"},{"surface":"நனி","parts":[{"text":"நனி","lemma":"நனி","gloss":"greatly"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"வெய்யள்","parts":[{"text":"வெய்","lemma":"வெய்யள்","gloss":"desirous"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"அள்","gloss":"she"}],"gloss":"is very desirous of him"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எந்தை","parts":[{"text":"எந்தை","lemma":"எந்தை","gloss":"my father"}],"gloss":"my father"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"too"},{"surface":"கொடீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"கொடு","lemma":"கொடு","gloss":"give"},{"text":"ஈஇயர்","lemma":"ஈஇயர்","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"to give in marriage"},{"surface":"வேண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டும்","lemma":"வேண்டு","gloss":"desires"}],"gloss":"desires"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அம்பல்","parts":[{"text":"அம்பல்","lemma":"அம்பல்","gloss":"gossip"}],"gloss":"gossiping"},{"surface":"ஊர்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"}],"gloss":"town"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"too"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"ஒடு","parts":[{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with"},{"surface":"மொழிமே","parts":[{"text":"மொழி","lemma":"மொழி","gloss":"speak"},{"text":"மே","lemma":"மே","gloss":"clitic"}],"gloss":"speaks"}]}],"literal":"Curved-thorned mundaka plant's sharp-dewy dark flowers, / like pearls severed from a thread, by the wind being scattered, / on every shore spreading on the pure sand, the lord of such a coast, / I too am in love with him, my mother too is very desirous of him, / my father too desires to give me in marriage to him, / and the gossiping town too speaks of none but him!","translation":"The sharp, dewy, dark flowers of the curved-thorned mundaka plant are scattered by the wind like pearls broken from their thread, spreading across the pure sand of every shore. I am in love with the lord of that coast. My mother too is very fond of him, and my father too wishes to give me to him in marriage. Even this gossiping town speaks only of him!","modern":"வளைந்த முட்களைக் கொண்ட முண்டகச் செடியின் கூர்மையான, பனி பொருந்திய கரிய மலர்கள், நூல் அறுந்த முத்துக்களைப் போலக் காற்றினால் சிதறி, கடற்கரையின் தூய மணல் பரப்பிலெல்லாம் பரவிக் கிடக்கும். அத்தகைய நெய்தல் நிலத் தலைவனை நானும் காதலிக்கிறேன். என் தாயும் அவனை மிகவும் விரும்புகிறாள். என் தந்தையும் என்னை அவனுக்கே மணம் முடித்துக் கொடுக்க விரும்புகிறார். இந்த அலர் தூற்றும் ஊரும் அவனையே என்னோடு சேர்த்துப் பேசுகிறது.","explanation":"The friend is speaking to the heroine, expressing her joy that the secret love affair is now moving smoothly toward a public marriage. She notes that not only does the heroine love the lord of the coast, but her mother is also very fond of him, her father wishes to give her in marriage, and even the gossiping town is linking their names. The opening image describes the dark flowers of the curved-thorned mundaka plant being scattered by the wind like pearls broken from a thread, spreading over the white sands. This represents the secret love which was once hidden but has now been scattered and made public through the town's gossip. However, instead of causing harm, this public exposure has led to the parents' consent, turning a potentially painful situation into a beautiful union, just as the scattered dark flowers beautify the white sand.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.97],[0.97,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,3.39],[3.39,3.64],[3.64,3.9],[3.9,4.2],[4.2,5.6],[5.6,6.05],[6.05,6.28],[6.5,7.0],[7.0,8.3],[8.3,8.8],[8.8,9.81],[9.81,10.1],[10.1,11.1],[11.1,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.97],[12.97,13.5],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,14.15]],"female":[[0.0,0.49],[0.49,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,2.74],[2.74,3.25],[3.25,3.64],[3.64,4.03],[4.03,4.67],[4.67,5.96],[5.96,6.6],[6.6,7.19],[7.19,7.54],[7.54,8.01],[8.01,8.48],[8.48,8.95],[8.95,12.4],[12.4,12.9],[12.9,13.3],[13.3,13.57],[14.1,14.9],[14.9,15.3],[15.3,15.8]]},"sync":[[["கூன்முண்",""]],[["முண்டகக்",""]],[["கூர்ம்பனி",""]],[["மாமலர்",""]],[["நூல்","thread"],["அறு","broken"]],[["முத்து","pearl"],["இன்","like"]],[["கால்","wind"],["ஒடு","with"]],[["பாறி","having scattered"]],[["துறை","shore"],["தொறும்","every"]],[["பரக்கும்","spreading"]],[["தூ","pure"],["மணல்","sand"]],[["சேர்ப்பனை","the lord of the coast"]],[["யான்","I"],["உம்","too"]],[["காதலென்","am in love"]],[["யாய்","my mother"],["நனி","greatly"]],[["வெய்யள்","is very desirous of him"]],[["எந்தை","my father"],["உம்","too"]],[["கொடீஇயர்","to give in marriage"]],[["வேண்டும்","desires"]],[["அம்பல்","gossiping"]],[["அம்பல்","gossiping"],["ஊர்","town"],["உம்","too"]],[["அவன்","he"],["ஒடு","with"]],[["மொழிமே","speaks"]]]}